{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single\n「Lonesome rabbit」\n「What’s “KAZOKU”?」\n本日発売日です\nいつも応援してくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めての、両A面シングルになります\n表題曲が2曲 !\n不思議な感じです\nどちらも素敵な楽曲。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Lonesome rabbit\nhttps://youtu.be/4HfAH746QJo"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "What’s “KAZOKU”?\nhttps://youtu.be/4SdeuouXcWI"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "コインランドリー\nhttps://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob6qSIrF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobl05eYi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobX5Nakt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回もマネージャーさんカメラ。\nすっごい自然な笑顔\n穏やかな撮影現場でした~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNKfejR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobExleiu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "珍しい髪型にも挑戦してみました\nメイクさんと話し合って決めた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobsJ42TM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobasD7cV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「コインランドリー」\nとても綺麗に撮っていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "衣装が繊細で\n美しかったです\nそして理子ちゃんは本当に綺麗だーー…\n美人さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobzZTCDE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優月ちゃん\n今回はお姉さんずに挟まれています\nなんて安心。\nこのシングル期間とっても楽しみです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobDPuGIk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single もよろしくお願いいたします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "村山美羽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobfCYFPL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りの一枚。\n櫻坂、好きだなあってなった写真"}], "source": "official"}